# Astro + Keystatic

- `astro.config.mjs` enables Keystatic **only when `astro dev`** so production stays pure static for GitHub Pages
- Site URL: `https://leonardosforza.github.io` (`base: '/'` for user Pages)
- Content collections defined in `src/content.config.ts` must stay aligned with `keystatic.config.ts`
- Letter route: `/letters/[letter]/` · Entry route: `/letters/[letter]/[entry]/`
- After schema changes, verify `npm run build` still prerenders all published letters/entries

Do not add a server adapter unless the user explicitly wants hosted Keystatic on production.
